                                "text": "\"[…]a breast and placket, taces, gorget, a burgonet with a buffe or chin peece,\" and also \"Armour richly quilt and graven consisting of a backe, breast, cushes, a paire of kneecops, gorget, a pair of short taces, one burgonet […]\""
