                                "text": "[…] quissers or cushes covered with cloth of camaca, for the protection of legs and thighs (I. 649); and lastly, a bequest of a targett or shield (II. 657), and of a bokeler covered with plates of silver ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3d5381c-de73-4a10-af06-40f938e03444",
